{"id":"656084","name":"凉拌木耳干豆皮","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/656084/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干豆皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干豆皮，备用。","img":"images/656084/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干豆皮用水泡发，泡好后攥干。","img":"images/656084/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切寸段，水开，上笼蒸三分钟即可。","img":"images/656084/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡发好的木耳，焯水，过凉水捞出，沥干水分，备用。","img":"images/656084/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜切碎，备用。","img":"images/656084/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切好的葱和香菜，备用。","img":"images/656084/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蒜末和辣椒粉和适量盐，放入碗中，起锅烧热油，将热油倒在碗里，再倒入少许醋、鸡精和白糖调味，拌匀即可。","img":"images/656084/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"豆皮和木耳放入盆中。","img":"images/656084/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入料汁。","img":"images/656084/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/656084/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/656084/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"清爽可口。","img":"images/656084/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}